# Firecrawl ↔ Context7 Cross-Check

Use skill `firecrawl-context7-crosscheck` when both Firecrawl vendor captures
and Context7 are in scope for a library entry.

## Required behavior

1. Produce `indexes/<entry>/firecrawl-context7-crosscheck.json` on every build
   that touches vendor pages or Context7 shards.
2. Record `gap_notes` per priority page; do not ignore `context7_only_terms`.
3. Add thin captures to `capture-backlog.yml` when cross-check flags gaps.
4. Re-scrape with **markdown** (not summary-only) before marking the entry complete.

## Pairing

Run after `vendor-doc-collection` or `library-entry-build` Firecrawl phase.
Run before `library-entry-validate`.
